{"version":1,"key":"card:75","content":{"id":75,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"包在国外服务器，下载速度慢，下载位于国内镜像源上的包。通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"pip","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 下载包时通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"-i","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 选项指定镜像源地址"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"pip install -i https://pypi.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/simple","language":"bash","uuid":"e50137d9-6050-45ac-917f-312e0a1bc144","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"每次下载包时都要指定太麻烦，将其写入配置文件，一劳永逸。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Linux：在 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"~/.pip/pip.conf","code":true},{"text":" 文件中配置：","type":"formatted"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"[global]\nindex-url = https://pypi.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/simple","language":"ini","uuid":"bcfb7c4b-111e-4cfa-8ae8-610034fcb3be","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Windows：在 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"~/pip/pip.ini","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 文件中配置："}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"[global]\nindex-url = https://pypi.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/simple","language":"bash","uuid":"ba3487d4-46d6-4cb1-b3de-76888451303e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["Python/pip","镜像源/pip"],"createTime":1689167406648,"updateTime":1743303640389,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640389}}